    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "5 Bedroom Detached Residence & Garage on c. 1.5 Acre Site"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Located within the National (2017) & Multi Award winning Village of Rathbarry, this Property offers an unique opportunity to acquire a quality home within this attractive village, being adjacent to the beautiful Castlefreke Woodland Walks and Long Strand Beach.\r\nStanding on a mature landscaped Site, having a great selection of various shrubs and mature broadleaf trees.\r\nInternally, this is a large spacious home (c. 1,802 sq. ft) offering great opportunities to a would-be purchaser.\r\nThe Property has the benefit of a Mains Water, Private Drainage, Electricity, OFCH and Wood Burning External Stove.\r\nCork Airport - 58 kms; Clonakilty - 8 kms; Rosscarbery - 6 kms, Owenahincha - 2kms\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
